WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.804
Nominal variables distinguish categories without
placing them in a meaningful order Blood

00:00:06.830 --> 00:00:12.354
types are different but one blood type is not
greater than another ZIP

00:00:12.368 --> 00:00:18.276
codes and patient IDs are common traps because they
may contain digits Counts

00:00:18.302 --> 00:00:25.232
and proportions are natural summaries and bar charts
are usually a good starting visualization The

00:00:25.245 --> 00:00:28.587
important rule is not to invent numerical meaning
for a label
